mnx|n|To draw the outline of; to delineate. ; To compose and write; as, to draft a memorial. ; To draw from a military band or post, or from any district, company, or society; to detach; to select. ; To transfer by draft.	a:1sq8,61,5;12nb,40,3;sli,35,26;nc2,33,1~sli,35,26;1sq8,61,5;12nb,40,3;nc2,33,1	n:1nlk,50,4;1vb,43,5;23t2,41,8;1hhv,7,3~23t2,41,8;1vb,43,5;1nlk,50,4;1hhv,7,3	N:1vxr,90,4;1vxm,80,10;36m,69,4;jmg,62,4;1nao,47,5;2968,44,2;o63,40,4;1hhy,26,5;1hhv,1,2~1vxm,80,10;1hhy,26,5;1nao,47,5;jmg,62,4;1vxr,90,4;36m,69,4;o63,40,4;2968,44,2;1hhv,1,2
